---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Vishal Gakhare | Software Engineering Leader"
  description="Senior software engineering leader with AWS, distributed systems, and platform modernization experience."
>
  <section class="card section reveal">
    <p style="text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--brand); margin: 0; font-size: 0.8rem;">Software Engineering Leader</p>
    <h1 style="margin: 0.4rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.1;">I build reliable platforms and scalable cloud systems.</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--text-1); max-width: 70ch; margin-bottom: 0;">
      Based in Richmond, VA. I lead teams at the intersection of architecture, cloud modernization, and high-impact delivery.
      My background spans telephony, banking, distributed services, and data processing at enterprise scale.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="grid cols-2 reveal delay" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
    <article class="card section">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Professional Snapshot</h2>
      <ul style="margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--text-1);">
        <li>Sr Lead Software Engineer at Capital One (2022 - Present)</li>
        <li>14+ years in cloud-native systems, backend engineering, and modernization</li>
        <li>Hands-on with Node.js/TypeScript, Python, Java, C#, AWS, and data platforms</li>
        <li>Domain expertise across Banking, Securities, and Telecom</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="card section">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Core Strengths</h2>
      <ul style="margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--text-1);">
        <li>System architecture and platform design</li>
        <li>Cloud migration and operational excellence</li>
        <li>Engineering leadership and cross-team execution</li>
        <li>Performance tuning and reliability improvements</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="card section reveal" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Recent Focus Areas</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--text-1); margin-bottom: 0;">
      AWS Contact Lens evaluations, modernization strategy, reliability engineering practices, and raising test automation maturity.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
